# See https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/getting-started-with-git/ignoring-files for more about ignoring files.

# A Windows program run with %SystemDrive% unexpanded and the repo as its working
# directory writes Windows' own icon/app cache here (cversions.2.db, {GUID}.ver…db
# — found 6 Oct 2026, nearly committed). Never project files.
/%SystemDrive%/

